  0,                      !- Fraction Radiant
  0,                      !- Fraction Lost
  General;                !- End-Use Subcategory

HVACTemplate:Thermostat,
  Cell Tstat,             !- Name
  Meas Tcell,             !- Heating Setpoint Schedule Name
